---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About | Jade Collective">
  <section class="bg-cream-alt">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-20 sm:px-8 sm:py-28">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-espresso sm:text-5xl">
          Management with intention.
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-relaxed text-espresso/80">
          Jade Collective is a boutique talent management studio built around
          a simple belief: small creators deserve serious representation.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-espresso/80">
          I&rsquo;m Sandi — a talent manager who spent enough time watching
          micro creators get underpaid and overlooked to want to do something
          about it. The big agencies chase the big numbers. I&rsquo;d rather
          build careers from the ground up, with the people doing the most
          interesting work before the rest of the world catches on.
        </p>

        <hr class="my-12 border-stone/60" />

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-espresso">
          What that looks like in practice
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-espresso/80">
          I take on a small roster — intentionally. Every creator I represent
          gets hands-on management, honest guidance, and someone who treats
          their brand like the business it is. I handle the deals, the
          negotiations, the awkward money conversations, and the strategy, so
          you get your time and energy back for the part only you can do —
          creating.
        </p>

        <hr class="my-12 border-stone/60" />

        <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-espresso">
          What I care about
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-espresso/80">
          Taste over trends. Long-term careers over quick wins. Rates that
          reflect real worth. And a way of working that feels calm,
          considered, and human — not the frantic hustle the internet sells
          you.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-olive text-cream">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-16 sm:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-cream/85">
          If that sounds like the kind of partnership you&rsquo;ve been
          looking for, I&rsquo;d love to hear from you.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="mt-6 inline-block cursor-pointer rounded-sm bg-cream px-7 py-3.5 font-body text-sm font-medium text-espresso transition-colors duration-200 hover:bg-cream-alt"
        >
          Get in touch
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
